---
import ResponsiveContainer from './ResponsiveContainer.astro';
import Typography from './Typography.astro';
---

<ResponsiveContainer background="white">
  <div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-10 md:flex-row">
    <div
      class="service-card bg-hover-slide-card group relative flex h-80 max-h-80 flex-col gap-5 overflow-hidden rounded-md p-[33px]"
    >
      <div class="bg-hover-slide-layer bg-primary-blue"></div>
      <div class="service-card-img relative z-10">
        <img
          src="/img/icons/iconGreen.webp"
          alt="Icono servicio"
          class="h-10 w-10 object-contain"
        />
      </div>
      <Typography
        as="h4"
        variant="h4"
        class="relative z-10 text-2xl font-bold text-black group-hover:text-white"
        >Servicios</Typography
      >
      <Typography
        as="p"
        variant="paragraph"
        class="relative z-10 text-black group-hover:text-white"
      >
        Desarrollo a medida para desafíos reales. Desde arquitecturas web robustas y aplicaciones
        móviles hasta automatización inteligente.
      </Typography>
    </div>

    <div
      class="service-card bg-hover-slide-card group relative flex h-80 max-h-80 flex-col gap-5 overflow-hidden rounded-md p-[33px]"
    >
      <div class="bg-hover-slide-layer bg-primary-blue"></div>
      <div class="service-card-img relative z-10">
        <img
          src="/img/icons/iconBlue.webp"
          alt="Icono servicio"
          class="h-10 w-10 rotate-45 object-contain"
        />
      </div>
      <Typography
        as="h4"
        variant="h4"
        class="relative z-10 text-2xl font-bold text-black group-hover:text-white"
        >Crazy Partner</Typography
      >
      <Typography
        as="p"
        variant="paragraph"
        class="relative z-10 text-black group-hover:text-white"
      >
        Ampliamos tu equipo al instante para que dejes de rechazar proyectos y conviertas cada
        solicitud en una nueva oportunidad de negocio.
      </Typography>
    </div>

    <div
      class="service-card bg-hover-slide-card group relative flex h-80 max-h-80 flex-col gap-5 overflow-hidden rounded-md p-[33px]"
    >
      <div class="bg-hover-slide-layer bg-primary-blue"></div>
      <div class="service-card-img relative z-10">
        <img
          src="/img/icons/iconOrange.webp"
          alt="Icono servicio"
          class="h-10 w-10 object-contain"
        />
      </div>
      <Typography
        as="h4"
        variant="h4"
        class="relative z-10 text-2xl font-bold text-black group-hover:text-white"
        >Proyectos</Typography
      >
      <Typography
        as="p"
        variant="paragraph"
        class="relative z-10 text-black group-hover:text-white"
      >
        Nuestras soluciones no conocen fronteras. Diseñamos pensando en la escalabilidad global y la
        adaptabilidad cultural.
      </Typography>
    </div>
  </div>
</ResponsiveContainer>

<style>
  .service-card {
    background-color: var(--color-gray-new);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px var(--color-primary-new-with-transparency);
    transition: box-shadow 0.4s ease;
  }

  .service-card:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }

  /* Imagen oculta que aparece en hover y empuja el contenido */
  .service-card-img {
    max-height: 0;
    opacity: 0;

    transition:
      max-height 0.4s ease,
      opacity 0.3s ease;
  }

  .service-card:hover .service-card-img {
    max-height: 60px;
    opacity: 1;
  }
</style>
